# event-budget mainly on participant cost of the event
what it returns: calculates the total variables cost per attendee (food + transport) multiplied by the number of attendees. returns an integer.
Test run: Normal attendee count (10, 800, 200)-> expected 100000, actual 10000. zero attendee (0, 8000, 200) -> expected 0,actual 0.
any assumption or unresolved issue: none. assumes all inputs are non negative numbers.



